+ .                .               .              .               .
+ .             DEACT              .            DISC              . DISC
+ o------------------------------->o----------------------------->o----->
+ .             DEACT              .       DM     .       DM      . DM
+ o<-------------------------------o<-------------o<--------------o<-----
